WEBVTT

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:58.950
Don't think you can get away with this!

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:02.580
Useless old man!

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:07.130
Stop!

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:09.000
Let me go!

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:09.590
Wait.

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:17.550
I have decided she is my woman. Don't you dare touch her.

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:18.340
Got it?

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:22.430
Alright! Let's get out of here!

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:45.500
They will all die. Die...

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:53.800
They were Falcon's men. They came by jeep - they took the women and food...

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:56.380
What about my wife and daughter?

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:58.010
Taken by them...

00:01:58.010 --> 00:01:58.970
Which way?!

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:00.390
West...

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:02.560
I'll kill them all!

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:31.250
I held my breath and kept waiting while my heart was scratched away

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:42.600
A minute, a second never felt so long

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:54.360
I look up at the sky and ask the wind, "Can I fly now?"

00:02:54.570 --> 00:03:00.660
The weak person I was is no more

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:06.240
I decided to just believe

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:13.380
With the dreams I once had in my hand now

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:17.210
I go towards you

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:24.930
Carrying those emotions I felt when I broke

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:29.060
I go towards you

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:33.100
Blown by the wind

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:38.570
Oh blown

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:48.040
Garimpeiro

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:02.550
Are you Mario?

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:03.010
Yes...

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.350
You're... Mr. Duke Togo?

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:08.890
Tell me your story.

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:14.900
Garimpeiro...

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:17.690
The ones who dig natural diamonds?

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:18.520
Yes...

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:20.820
But they...

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:23.740
They're villains who go by the name Galimpeiro.

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:28.200
They were chased out by police, and have taken to the Amazon.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:41.010
Their leader is called Falcon, damn him!

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:51.060
I want you to kill him and all of his men.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:02.190
They... beat my entire family to death.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:10.490
This is your payment, stolen from them.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.500
How did you hear about me?

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:18.920
My watchmen were saying there is a hit man out there like the Grim Reaper.

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:21.000
Your wife and daughter?

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:24.760
Already discarded, thrown into the field.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.680
Go to the police.

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:30.640
The police are useless!

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:35.020
The government's special police are demons!

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:38.600
Devils taking advantage of hunting the Garimpeiro.

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:45.530
They attack farms and houses, making it look like the Garimpeiro are responsible.

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:54.080
The police know all about it...

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:59.580
If they pursue seriously, the Garimpeiro will return to town.

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:03.130
For the police, it's better to do nothing.

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:50.300
Amazon eh?

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:53.550
The neighbouring guerrillas have been sneaking in...

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:58.230
The government also plans to strengthen the police, under command of the army.

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:02.940
This is the High Mobility Multi-purpose Wheeled Vehicle, the M1114 HMMWV.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:07.860
Top speed of 125KPH on paved surfaces, peak horse power of 190.

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:12.070
Ring mount an M2 heavy machine gun please.

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:14.990
Include ten thousand 12.7mm rounds.

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:15.950
Understood.

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:20.870
The AT4 recoilless rifle, would you to install a grenade launcher?

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:25.130
I'd like a Mk 19. And some stinger missiles.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:44.110
Here you go.

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:46.690
Thank you.

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:48.690
Would you like a blanket?

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:50.150
No, thank you.

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:51.280
Enjoy the flight.

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.050
What the?!

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:20.140
Everyone please calm down! Please walk to the front of the aircraft.

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:24.060
Don't worry! I'm a sky marshal. Calm do-

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:34.200
Everyone please calm down! The gas is apparently non-toxic. Remain calm.

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:37.700
Don't make a sound.

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:42.080
This gun belonged to the Sky Marshal, who is now taking a nap.

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.370
Go to the cockpit.

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:52.050
Follow my orders.

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:05.100
Describe the situation.

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:09.320
There was a disturbance caused by smoke at 21:14.

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:12.820
After thirty minutes we received a message to the effect that the plane had been hijacked.

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:14.070
How many suspects?

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:17.110
At this point there's only one confirmed hijacker.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:19.620
Just one? Weapons?

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:24.620
We're not sure how, but he appears to have robbed the Sky Marshal of his weapon.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:25.920
Any casualties?

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:27.540
None as of yet.

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:31.960
He has demanded a ransom of three million dollars in cash.

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:32.800
Is it ready?

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:34.470
We're working on it.

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:38.220
Flight 677 is arriving.

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:47.270
This is Purple One. I'm in position.

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:52.980
Red One, standby OK.

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:57.150
Yellow Two, in position.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:10:00.490
Yellow Three, in position.

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:02.950
Yellow Four, in position.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:05.330
Okay, standby for further orders.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:13.340
Chief Reagan, there is just one target. Let's attack with force.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:14.880
Don't panic.

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:18.180
There's still a chance for negotiation.

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:19.340
He's on the phone.

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:22.890
This is Reagan of the FBI.

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:26.270
We appreciate that there have been no casualties.

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:30.440
We are doing our best to fill your demands.

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:32.270
It's been a while Reagan.

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:34.780
This voice...

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:40.990
I will exchange the passengers in exchange for the ransom.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:43.580
I will only wait two hours.

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:45.620
You...

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:47.160
Why?

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:50.790
If you attack, they will all die.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:52.960
Don't forget this.

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:54.960
Disconnected.

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:57.510
Chief...

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:03.300
Chief, do you know the hijacker?

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:06.560
Chief!

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:10.730
Prepare the money immediately!

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:12.610
Y... yes sir!

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:51.020
You. As I suspected.

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:57.520
Show me the money.

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:02.320
Good. Give it to me.

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:06.080
Tell me, why are you doing this?

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.870
I don't have time to explain. Get off.

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:24.510
Please wait.

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:38.440
Situation report!

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:41.110
Eighty percent of the passengers have been evacuated.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:42.280
No fatalities.

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.610
Two passengers incapacitated with shock.

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:45.660
The crew?

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.280
Not yet released.

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:49.160
Understood.

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:40.040
A stormy petrel has flown away.

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:44.840
Golgo... I mean, the hijacker. What was in the case?

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:47.930
The explosive ordinance disposal unit is currently examining it.

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:51.810
Chief! Don't get too close!

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:58.770
This is.. three million-dollars! The ransom money!

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:02.940
What in the world...

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:05.690
What is he trying to pull?

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:11.700
Listen. Nobody speaks about this.

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:15.910
No one talks until we know what's going on. Got it?

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:18.670
Fly southeast.

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:20.000
Where are you going?

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.250
The Amazon.

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:43.020
Hijacker has jumped out of the plane. Location is east of the Amazon River.

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:06.840
The Hijacker is an Asian male.

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:10.050
If you see him, kill him.

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:13.220
If it wasn't him, make up an excuse.

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:17.180
We'll get that money for sure, got it?

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:17.560
Yes sir!

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:21.560
Three million dollars, huh.

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:23.650
Are they looking for us?

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:26.360
If they are, we're in the shit.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.650
It's the three million dollars.

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:31.070
Three million dollars?

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:35.740
A hijacker fled here with a three million dollar ransom.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.660
He's in the jungle somewhere.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:41.120
The police were talking about it on the radio.

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:43.580
Is he still on the run?

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:46.590
Yeah, they're eager to find him.

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:53.640
If we fall behind the police, we are unworthy of our name.

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:55.680
Right. Let's gather the lads.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:59.850
Nothing here. Try the south.

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:01.060
How about your area?

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:02.190
Nothing.

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:04.610
Seems like they haven't found him yet.

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:05.650
What?!

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:06.980
Found him?!

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:16.530
That's right. I heard that something fell down around the east pond. A kid says he saw it.

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:21.040
I found a parachute that was probably his.

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:38.640
There! It's him!

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:46.900
Good! He's trapped by the water. There's nowhere to run!

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:23.770
Shit.

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:25.770
Don't stick together! Spread out!

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:36.820
The Garimpeiro are swarming their prey ahead of us.

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:39.280
Forward the location to the troops.

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:39.870
Yes sir!

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:52.750
What's up?

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:56.470
There's a small battle taking place in the Amazon Basin.

00:17:56.930 --> 00:17:58.800
Our hijacker might be involved.

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:01.390
I'll be right over.

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:14.400
Is it really him?

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:17.200
That's the most likely explanation.

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:19.450
Who's he fighting with?

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:23.910
I heard it's the Manaus garrison of the Amazon state police.

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:31.590
What was that?

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:33.170
It's a stinger missile!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:33.880
What?!

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:35.880
Missile incoming!

00:18:56.530 --> 00:19:00.860
I’ve investigated the recent situation around Manaus, but there is no information of value.

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:02.530
Even drug cartel skirmishes?

00:19:02.530 --> 00:19:02.990
Correct.

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:05.950
If it is Golgo...

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:08.910
Who could he be fighting for?

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:15.300
Satellite is leaving the area.

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:16.920
When will the next one be in range?

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:18.550
Twenty-five minutes, sir.

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:33.110
Boss! You're giving up on the three million dollars?

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:34.560
Idiots!

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:38.570
Even with a hundred lives we couldn't take that monster!

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:39.360
Let's go!

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:46.120
82nd platoon, respond! 83rd platoon, report the situation!

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:49.120
Someone... Anybody respond!

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:38.940
Chief, it seems there has been a battle in the remote wetlands of the Amazon.

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:40.860
A battle?

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:46.110
This battle - do you think it was related to our hijacker?

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:51.490
Golgo 13.

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:55.000
He did it singlehandedly.

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:56.920
For serious?

00:21:57.790 --> 00:22:00.000
Yes. Without a doubt.

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:04.210
Those three million dollars were just bait for the trap.

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:06.420
Just... bait?

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:07.930
However...

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:11.760
Who the hell asked him to clean up the Amazon?

00:22:33.740 --> 00:22:39.000
It doesn't matter anymore

00:22:39.750 --> 00:22:44.550
Who craved freedom first

00:22:45.710 --> 00:22:53.430
How we decided to part, and how we loved each other

00:22:53.720 --> 00:22:55.770
As nostalgic and simply just that

00:22:55.770 --> 00:23:03.860
Once you've lost it you'll feel lonely

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:07.780
You may have to overcome the pain

00:23:07.820 --> 00:23:13.030
Many times with that cruel heart of yours

00:23:13.070 --> 00:23:21.250
But you just can't become as strong as you've imagined

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:25.840
It was just a dream

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:29.260
So let us return to tomorrow

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:34.260
In this calm night

00:23:34.300 --> 00:23:36.510
There'll only be wanderers

00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:41.650
But now you've awakened, so walk down that path of yours

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:47.610
And even though time is fleeting

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:54.070
People sometimes desire too much

00:24:01.460 --> 00:24:04.750
At a lonely hotel in the Utah desert,

00:24:05.290 --> 00:24:06.750
Golgo stops by.

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:11.720
Here, the casino-robbing son makes his return.

00:24:12.720 --> 00:24:15.220
What is the true "aim" of Golgo's visit?

00:24:16.050 --> 00:24:19.930
A family's love and hate makes for an unexpected case.

00:24:20.930 --> 00:24:22.850
Next time, on Gargle 13!

00:24:21.100 --> 00:24:26.270
Indian Summer

00:24:22.850 --> 00:24:24.520
Indian Summer!

00:24:24.520 --> 00:24:28.400
Don't stand behind him if you value your life.
